            "description": "# ChatGPT TUI\n\nA modern TUI (Text User Interface) for the ChatGPT.\n\n`catt` is a Python-based Text User Interface (TUI) for ChatGPT, powered by OpenAI's official API. It provides an easy-to-use interface that allows you to interact with the ChatGPT chatbot directly from your terminal.\n\n> Please note that this project is in its early stages and is not yet ready for production use.\n\n## Installation\n\nTo install it, you can use pip, the Python package manager. First, make sure you have Python 3.7 or higher installed on your system. Then, open a terminal window and run the following command:\n\n```bash\npip install chatgpt_tui\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n### Export your OpenAI API key\n\nBefore using ChaTUI, you need to export your OpenAI API key as an environment variable:\n\n```bash\nexport OPENAI_API_KEY=your-api-key\n```\n\n### Launch ChaTUI\n\nTo start using ChaTUI, simply run the following command in your terminal:\n\n```bash\ncatt\n```\n\nThis will launch the ChaTUI interface and connect you to the ChatGPT chatbot.\n\n# License\n\nChaTUI is licensed under the MIT License.\n",
